      "message": "Sorry! I found I misunderstand. Dirks is use zephyr/subsys/ap_pwr. I\u0027m not sure why it doesn\u0027t sent shutdown reaseon AP_POWER_SHUTDOWN_POWERFAIL. The EC log shows \"power state 6 \u003d S0, in 0x30de3\" that PWR_SLP_SUS (0x00040) should be already asserted.",
